@startuml r20-5-detail-view-sections-chain
!theme plain
title R20.5 — Detail View Traceability Sections (3 UCs, singular chains)

left to right direction

package "T-singular-chain-detail" {

  package "(A) Singular Chain" {
    usecase "detailView.singularChainSection\nuc:28a397c4\ntask:f3e0b558" as UCA
    agent "RbDetailView.renderSingularChain\nclass:f2f84ce3\nmethod:09611d71" as MA
    UCA --> MA
  }

  package "(B) All Children" {
    usecase "detailView.allChildrenSection\nuc:ff90115d\ntask:f3e0b558" as UCB
    agent "RbDetailView.renderAllChildren\nclass:f2f84ce3\nmethod:bfbc0874" as MB
    UCB --> MB
  }

  package "(C) Superseded Links" {
    usecase "detailView.supersededLinks\nuc:843c9fdf\ntask:f3e0b558" as UCC
    agent "RbDetailView.renderSupersededLinks\nclass:f2f84ce3\nmethod:31c6e25e" as MC
    UCC --> MC
  }
}

note bottom
  UNIVERSAL across ALL detail-view types (not per-type).
  (A) Traceability Chain: ONLY chain nodes per UC context
      (narrow Class->Method to UC.method, not methods[] fan-out)
  (B) All Children: union of ALL model array-relationships
      (full forward adjacency, separate from chain)
  (C) Superseded: refinementOf/supersededBy/supersedes links
      (dedup traceability — which req replaced which)

  RED Tests:
  - (A) Class detail shows 1 method (chain-relevant), not all methods
  - (B) Class detail "All Children" shows all methods
  - (C) Refined req shows supersededBy link to parent
  Sprint: 64af2638
end note

@enduml
